<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Synoptic of the imaginary laser lab: laser, HHG source, toroidal mirror and sample chamber, with the pump
  beam over a delay stage. Every device has a button (…) opening its panel; the buttons in the header open
  the device groups (group.ui). The devices are simulated by simulator.py.
  No macros.
-->
